      "content": "there's no point in talking about how we got here. it doesn't change anything. the end is coming regardless. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could control how it ends... if i could just find a way to step out of this nightmare on my own terms before they force their way in. i just want it to be quiet. i want it to be over.",
